      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you detail why we need to do this templating? I\u0027m not sure that it is the best API to expose to the users but don\u0027t understand the benefit.",
      "revId": "9730b3be42b5dbd9132b7f3e328401f7a8a106ad",
